    248  f8fd							; CrunchClock / CrunchMasks DELETED (2026-10-19): their only caller was
    249  f8fd							; PhVcrEntry, which bank2 stopped tramping to in the Phase-B rework (vcrunch
    250  f8fd							; now stages its PF punch in bank2 VcrShutter and kills through VCS3). The
    251  f8fd							; live ping-pong formula is VcrStateTab (VBL) + VCS3 (kill) — both guarded.
    252  f8fd							; ==============================================================================
    253  f8fd							; Prefix tables: P(n) for n pairs from pair 0 — n = 0..10.
    254  f8fd							; Pair → register: 0-1 PF0 ($30,$C0), 2-5 PF1 ($C0,$30,$0C,$03),
    255  f8fd							; 6-9 PF2 ($03,$0C,$30,$C0). PF0 maxes at n=2, PF1 at n=6, PF2 at n=10.
    256  f980					      org	$F980
    257  f980				   CrPfx0
